(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-94","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["把物资归还原单位是一次[[unconventional|不同于惯例的]]分流，也是必须完成的[[undertaking|工作]]。受伤不是[[unfortunate|不幸的]]人应得的结局，[[unhappy|不快乐的]]家属按表获赔。接续[[unit|单位]]不能[[universally|笼统地]]称人人康复。[[university|大学]]人员只签亲见结果，临床[[unknown|未知的]]部分继续评估。病人也不必接受[[unlikely|不大可能的]]奇迹保证，基金并无[[unlimited|无限的]]免责，[[unlucky|倒霉的]]说法不能遮选择。杜医生把六孩的接续记录逐名给家属，愿意留下的治疗与生活支持都有联系人，不是只在我们关心时才存在。","拒绝[[unnecessary|不必要的]]隐瞒，曾被说成[[unorthodox|不合惯例]]。未必[[unprecedented|史无前例的]]改革才算有用，[[unsatisfactory|不满意的]]旧回复可以重写。那座[[unstable|不稳的]]平台停用检修，正常援助无需[[untie|解开]]危险箱。老陈[[unusually|格外地]]安静，把维修记录放[[upon|在…上]]桌子。港口没有[[uproar|喧闹]]庆功，[[upside-down|倒置的]]旧负荷板撤下，办公室[[upstairs|楼上]]的空载显示也停。所谓[[uptodate|最新的]]系统要留下人工确认，不因屏幕数字一路[[upward|向上]]，人就只能[[upwards|往上]]追着跑。叶澄说明改正自己能负责的部分，仍接受工程责任处理。","旧[[uranium|铀]]展图返回馆，不把一张原子教具图变成箱内物质。[[used|二手的]]器件分存，可[[useful|有用的]]才按实际条件使用，每个[[user|使用者]]获完整来历。诊所[[usual|日常的]]早餐与[[utensil|器皿]]另有供应，公共卫生人员继续按正常工作给孩子[[vaccinate|预防接种]]，不是给查案发奖励。清洁单[[validity|有效性]]要实际核验，博物馆[[vault|拱顶]]修好了，[[venus|金星]]模型重回架。写在说明上的[[verb|动词]]‘已完成’必须等完成；它曾[[vex|使苦恼]]工人，现在终于不能一笔命令他们替纸去做还没发生的事实。","我们没有[[victorious|得胜的]]合影，所谓[[victory|胜利]]先是一张到帐回执。原[[videotape|录像磁带]]各归档馆，临河人还得用[[vigor|精力]]与[[vigour|力量]]整理日常。基金租的[[villa|别墅]]腾作公开接收站，院里[[vine|藤]]的影在墙上。阿芬不再[[violently|激烈地]]责怪自己，当初没有告诉孩子受伤，不代表不够勇敢；她说[[vitally|紧要地]]需要的是工资按时付。旧[[vitamine|维生素]]商标页只归药史展，不当新营养证明。她把明天上班表拿给家属看，收入与身体检查都有安排，害怕也可以慢慢说，不用为给我们一个圆满结尾就立刻消失。","程雾[[vividly|清楚地]]记得三个呼叫位置，却想录新的[[volleyball|排球]]场。校史讲义的[[vowel|元音]]错印由吴老师校订，所有涉及接收与条件的译文重新发给相关单位。翻译员的异议进入正式记录，馆员拿回授权展品目录，旧维修工得到应付维修款与索赔答复，不必撤证换钱。母亲给老陈铺子请了年轻帮手，工资在大家分担和损失赔付中落实；老陈有权说不要过分帮，但不能要求别人假装他的右腕马上能抬重物。小唐把女儿画带回家，没有将它送给我们作战利品。","几个月后的裁判与责任处理文件送达，贺青对欺骗核验、隐瞒风险继续转运承担相应责任，梁朔等具体执行者依各自行为处理；叶澄承担提前验收与缺项检查的工程责任，补记与合作有记录，没有变成无事发生。赔偿到账，病人接续就医，危险物由专业单位完成处置并逐批注销，旧港检修后按实测重新开放。老陈仍在康复，教帮手认零件而不再举重箱。程雾约我周末去岸边录普通潮声，我说等母亲也空下来。接下来的日子不用从下一只未知箱开始，要从已经归还的椅子和一个能慢慢坐下的人开始。"],"en":["An [[unconventional|unconventional]] distribution completed a necessary [[undertaking|undertaking]]. Injury was no ending [[unfortunate|unfortunate]] people deserved. [[unhappy|Unhappy]] families received arranged compensation. The receiving [[unit|unit]] could not [[universally|universally]] declare recovery. [[university|University]] specialists signed observed results; [[unknown|unknown]] clinical details remained assessed. Patients deserved no [[unlikely|unlikely]] miracle guarantee. Funds had no [[unlimited|unlimited]] exemption, nor did [[unlucky|unlucky]] erase choices. Du gave all six families continuing-care records with real contacts. Support would exist even when our attention moved elsewhere.","Refusing [[unnecessary|unnecessary]] concealment once seemed [[unorthodox|unorthodox]]. Useful change needed no [[unprecedented|unprecedented]] claim. [[unsatisfactory|Unsatisfactory]] answers were rewritten. The [[unstable|unstable]] platform closed; ordinary aid required nobody to [[untie|untie]] dangerous boxes. [[unusually|Unusually]] quiet Chen placed records [[upon|upon]] a table. No victory [[uproar|uproar]] followed. An [[upside-down|upside-down]] board came down; [[upstairs|upstairs]] unloaded values stopped. An [[uptodate|up-to-date]] system retained manual confirmation. Figures going [[upward|upward]] could not demand endless running [[upwards|upwards]]. Ye corrected work within her competence while accepting engineering responsibility.","A [[uranium|uranium]] exhibit image returned as a diagram, not evidence of contents. [[used|Used]] components were separated; [[useful|useful]] items retained conditions and provenance for each [[user|user]]. [[usual|Usual]] clinic breakfasts and [[utensil|utensils]] came separately. Public-health staff continued to [[vaccinate|vaccinate]] under ordinary care, not investigative rewards. Cleaning [[validity|validity]] required actual verification. A museum [[vault|vault]] was repaired; [[venus|Venus]] returned to its shelf. The [[verb|verb]] 'completed' must follow completion. It could no longer [[vex|vex]] workers by commanding reality to catch up with a prewritten statement.","There was no [[victorious|victorious]] photograph. [[victory|Victory]] first meant a payment receipt. Original [[videotape|videotapes]] returned to archives; daily work needed [[vigor|vigor]] and [[vigour|vigour]]. A fund [[villa|villa]] became an open reception centre beneath [[vine|vine]] shadows. A-Fen stopped [[violently|violently]] blaming herself for initially hiding injury from her child. Wages mattered [[vitally|vitally]]. An old [[vitamine|vitamine]] trademark belonged to history, no nutritional certificate. Her timetable showed income and health checks arranged. Fear could be discussed gradually, rather than disappear to satisfy our preferred ending.","Cheng remembered calls [[vividly|vividly]] but wanted new [[volleyball|volleyball]] recordings. Wu corrected a misprinted [[vowel|vowel]] and resent translations concerning conditions. The interpreter's objections became official records. The curator recovered authorized catalogues; the former worker received repair payment and an answered claim without withdrawing testimony. A young paid assistant helped Chen, funded through shared support and compensation. Nobody pretended his wrist could lift immediately. Tang took his daughter's drawing home, giving us no private paper as a trophy. Ordinary property finally resumed ordinary lives.","Months later decisions held He Qing accountable for deceptive verification and knowingly continued risky transport. Liang and others faced findings by actions; Ye bore early-acceptance and omitted-check responsibility. Cooperation did not erase conduct. Compensation arrived; patients had continuing care. Qualified services completed itemized disposal. Measured repairs reopened the port. Still recovering, Chen taught without lifting heavy crates. Cheng proposed weekend tide recording with Mother. The following days would start with returned chairs and people able to sit slowly, rather than another unknown box."]});
